\newlabel{fig:speedup_tradeoff}{{2}{8}{\textbf {Measured forward speed-up and aggregate \mf \ for the locked primary seed-42 configurations.} Only E0, E3 and E6 are shown. The left panel reports pooled Sleep-EDF \mf ; the right reports subject-mean \mf \ on the locked SHHS1 sample. Speed-up is relative to E0 in the fixed forward-pass benchmark. The plot was generated from archived aggregate results using an editable PGFPlots source; OpenAI Codex assisted with the plotting code}{figure.caption.7}{}}
